  "post_stream": {
    "posts": [
      {
        "id": 2860855,
        "name": "L0rdF1end",
        "username": "L0rdF1end",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.eveonline.com/l0rdf1end/{size}/407407_2.png",
        "created_at": "2026-04-10T07:27:34.271Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Taking Stain as an example.</p>\n<p>Looking at current kill volumes across nullsec hotspots, Stain doesn’t appear anywhere near the top activity regions. It never did, but recently its very very very slow.</p>\n<p>Stain is simply not generating enough PvE or PvP to attract roamers.</p>\n<p>Sansha space used to attract:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Ishtar ratters</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>T3C ratters</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Carrier krabs (back in the day)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Now?<br>\nMost krabbing has moved to:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Safer sov null</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Pochven</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>High‑end WHs</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>So hunters stopped coming, and roamers stopped following the hunters./</p>\n<p>Can we please consider generating reasons for folks to travel to Stain and other NPC regions?<br>\nThe mobile observatory blueprint helped a tiny bit but that was some time ago and NPC has been deeply unloved for many years now.</p>\n<p>Can we get some help to improve things just a little?</p>\n<p>I’m a long time player, mostly in NPC, thanks for hearing me.</p>",
