        "id": 2860963,
        "name": "Gerard Amatin",
        "username": "Gerard_Amatin",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.eveonline.com/gerard_amatin/{size}/481361_2.png",
        "created_at": "2026-04-10T13:36:54.102Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"L0rdF1end\" data-post=\"1\" data-topic=\"509629\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://sea1.discourse-cdn.com/eveonline/user_avatar/forums.eveonline.com/l0rdf1end/48/407407_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> L0rdF1end:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Can we please consider generating reasons for folks to travel to Stain and other NPC regions?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>As far as I know people always told me “Sansha space is great to explore in, but do not travel to Stain, people will kill you there”.</p>\n<p>I count 91 dead frigate explorers in Stain in the past week.</p>\n<p>So to me as explorer it sounds like there are good reasons to go to Stain, but the locals also gave good reasons to stay away.</p>",
