        "id": 2872230,
        "name": "L0rdF1end",
        "username": "L0rdF1end",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.eveonline.com/l0rdf1end/{size}/407407_2.png",
        "created_at": "2026-05-07T11:21:54.297Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Indeed, there was a lot of excitement at the time when FW was getting a rework, feeling the same style would move on to other areas.</p>\n<p>There’s a lot of stagnation in many facets that also do not only effect NPC space that could use a rework. Most combat sites do not pay out for time investment, AI diamond rats just are a hindrance and offer no value to game play.</p>\n<p>The events actually damage spawn rates of better sigs (Relics, WH’s, 10/10’s) that NPC players rely on.</p>\n<p>If specific sites could spawn in NPC like high-end gas, or another way (please don’t touch ratting) to interact with potential officers in combat sites.<br>\nAdding new NPC AI strongholds maybe? Like a Sansha variant..</p>",
        "post_number": 4,
